合約 Payments
parties 我方

thing Payment
  金額 HKD
  directors list 真人 at most 5

可 disburse by we
  超过 1_000_000 requires 2人批核 by directors in person 7天内
  active -> disbursed

test "two directors approve a large payment"
  we 建立 with amount = 港元 2_000_000, directors = (alice, bob, carol)
  我方 disburse by dave 親身確認 -> pending approval
  we 批准 由 alice in person -> 待批准
  we approve by alice 本人确认 -> refused "bo:approved disburse"
  我方 approve 由 erin in person -> 被拒絕 "bo:approver disburse"
  we 批准 by bob -> refused "bo:in-person disburse"
  我方 approve by bob 親身確認 -> disbursed

测试 "a small payment needs nobody"
  we create with 金额 = HKD 500, directors = (alice, bob, carol)
  我方 disburse -> disbursed

test "approvals lapse"
  我方 create 連同 amount = HKD 2_000_000, directors = (alice, bob, carol) at 2027-01-04
  we disburse 由 alice in person -> 待批准
  we 批准 by bob 本人确认 时间 2027-01-12 -> refused "bo:lapsed disburse"
